# Every QML type in this directory, listed so that qmllint (and editors) can
# resolve them. Quickshell resolves file-local types on its own, so this file
# changes nothing at runtime — it exists purely for tooling.
#
# Keep in sync when adding or removing a .qml file here. `pragma Singleton`
# types must be listed with the `singleton` prefix: Theme, Paths, Backlight, Cmd,
# Hypr and TailscaleService. Settings.qml is deliberately NOT a singleton (see its
# header) and is listed as a plain type.

